      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>It would be fantastic if <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" data-account-id=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" accountid=\"5cdf0dfb3b428d0dcd7c7c4d\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Former user</a> and <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" data-account-id=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" accountid=\"5fc7c7e5dd0c59007543ad76\" rel=\"noreferrer\">kestlund</a> could provide an example format of an acceptable \"audit log\".<br/>\n..such as:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>&lt;date-time&gt; export &lt;URI&gt; to &lt;path&gt;\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>..or</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>&lt;date-time&gt; import &lt;path&gt; to &lt;URI&gt;\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
     "created": "21/Sep/16 1:20 PM",
     "id": "17591",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12185/comment/17591",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
